EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Он
забыл все
слова кроме
слова чума.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-tab-count:1">      </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>С
утра было
лето, а
теперь зима,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Hm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">               
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
