<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Наверно
мой ревер
сошёл с ума.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Я
устал пить
чай, устал
пить вино,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Hm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'> <span style="mso-tab-count:2">            </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Em</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
